1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:13,810
Why did the writer not get off the bus at Woodford Green?
作者为什么没在伍德福德格林下车？

2
00:00:13,810 --> 00:00:18,860
Why did the writer not get off the bus at Woodford Green?
作者为什么没在伍德福德格林下车？

3
00:00:21,240 --> 00:00:23,530
I love travelling in the country,
我喜欢在乡间旅行，

4
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:26,490
but I don't like losing my way.
但我不喜欢迷路。

5
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:30,390
I went on an excursion recently,
最近我做了一次短途旅行，

6
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:33,650
but my trip took me longer than I expected.
但这次旅行花的时间比我预计的要长。

7
00:00:36,260 --> 00:00:37,750
'I'm going to Woodford Green,'
“我要去伍德福德格林，”

8
00:00:37,940 --> 00:00:41,250
I said to the conductor as I got on the bus,
我上车时对售票员说，

9
00:00:42,060 --> 00:00:43,570
'but I don't know where it is.'
“可我不知道它在什么地方。”

10
00:00:45,590 --> 00:00:47,600
'I'll tell you where to get off.'
“我会告诉您在哪儿下车。”

11
00:00:48,030 --> 00:00:49,580
answered the conductor.
售票员回答说。

12
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:55,270
I sat in the front of the bus to get a good view of the countryside.
我坐在车的前部，以便好好观赏乡村风光。

13
00:00:57,180 --> 00:00:59,650
After some time, the bus stopped.
过了一会儿，汽车停了下来。

14
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:07,450
Looking round, I realized with a shock that I was the only passenger left on the bus.
我环视四周，吃惊地发现车上只剩下我一个乘客了。

15
00:01:09,170 --> 00:01:10,540
'You'll have to get off here,'
“您得在这儿下车，”

16
00:01:10,610 --> 00:01:15,050
the conductor said. 'This is as far as we go.'
售票员说，“我们的车就开到这里。”

17
00:01:16,470 --> 00:01:18,980
'Is this Woodford Green?' I asked.
“这是伍德福德格林吗？”我问。

18
00:01:20,240 --> 00:01:24,590
'Oh dear,' said the conductor suddenly.
“哎呀，”售票员突然说，

19
00:01:25,980 --> 00:01:27,970
'I forgot to put you off.'
“我忘了让您下车了。”

20
00:01:29,410 --> 00:01:32,680
'It doesn't matter,' I said. 'I'll get off here.'
“没关系，”我说，“我就在这儿下吧。”

21
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:38,290
'We're going back now,' said the conductor.
“我们现在要往回开，”售票员说。

22
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:40,510
'Well, in that case,
“既然如此，”

23
00:01:40,840 --> 00:01:44,960
I prefer to stay on the bus,' I answered.
“我宁愿留在车上，”我回答说。
